<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- Dondo</book>
  <para style="h">YAKOBI</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zaki</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda wu Zaki</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda wusonika</para>
  <para style="mt1">Zaki</para>
  <para style="imt">Nkotolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu ni mukanda wu sonika Zaki ku bantu bamvimba ba Nzambi bamwangana ha luse lu butoto bebubu. Mu ntangu zihyoka, Zaki wuba munanga ha kati di minkwikidi mi mbanza Yelusalemi, na Yesu mpangi andi yidi. Bantu bakasonikina mukanda bewuwu, mwa ndambu yi bantu ha kati dyawu yita ti yikwikidi, mpeleko ndyatulu awu ka yiba bonso yi bantu bebobo bakwikidi ko. Ni hahoho, ka bateela ti kiminu kikwe yenikanga mu nkadulu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yakobi wuyuwa ti ha kati di minkwikidi, bamputu mpasi bedi yenanga, mu dyambu ti bamvwama bedi badyatanga bubwingi. Ni hahoho kateela ku bamvwama babika nkadulu yidi bonso bantu baa ha luse lu butoto bebubu, basimba bamputu mu moko mole. Wubwesa ta dyaka ti bamvimba babika mayuma na bazaba mu kanga minwa myawu. Ntangu zimvimba bafweti ba na nkadulu yimbote bonso buna ta Mambu ma Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndandani yi buuku bedidi ebu yidi:</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Mbote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:1">1.1</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Kiminu na ndwenga (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:2-18">1.2-18</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Nyuwasani yi Mambu ma Nzambi, na bwedi bwe hidikila bo bu mana ta (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:19-27">1.19-27</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Kuswasisandi bantu ko (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 2:1-13">2.1-13</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">5) Kiminu na nkadulu yimbote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 3:1-18">3.1-18</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">6) Ndwenga na nzonzolo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 3:1-18">3.1-18</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">7) Luzolo lu nza ludi lumbote ko (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 4:1-5:6">4.1–5.6</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">8) Luvibudulu na lusambulu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 5:7-20">5.7-20</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="s1">Zimbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Meno Zaki, mundongo wu Nzambi na wu Mfumu Yesu-Klisto, ku makanda kumi na mole maa mamwangana mu nza. Mbote zeno!<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntontolo na mvibudulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Mpangi zani, bongileeno ntontolo zi mumpila-mumpila zikwe lutudilanga bonso dyambu di kyese, <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />mpe luzebi ti, kiminu kikwe tontongo, kikwe haananga mvibudulu. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Kansi yeno yifweti ba yilunga mu mimvimba, mwanki luba bantu balunga mpe bafwana, na balembolo ba na dyambu dimbi. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Tala ti wumosi ha kati dyeno lembolo ba na ndwenga, kalomba zo ku Nzambi, kamuhaana zo. Mu dyambu ti, Nzambi kwe haananga ku bantu bamvimba mu mutima wumbote, mpe ka mu masembo ko. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Kansi kafweti lomba mu kiminu, ka muba na maketiketi ko. Mu dyambu ti yondowo kwe banga na maketiketi, fwanakani na bipo bi mubu, mupepe kakwe nangunanga na kakwe ningisanga ndambu ka ndambu. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Muntu wu bobobo ka banzandi ko ti waatambula kima ku Mfumu, <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />mu dyambu ti mabanza mandi yeku-yeku madi mpe ka na kivuvu mu mi kana sa ko.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mvwama na mputu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Bika mpangi yo yii mputu ka yangalala, mu dyambu ti Nzambi wumuzangudi, <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />mpe mvwama ka yangalala, Nzambi bu kamukuludi. Mu dyambu ti muntu wumvwama waazimbala bonso kifulu kimfuba. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Mwini bu waateka na mbangasi andi yingolo, waayumisa kititi, mboki kifulu kyaasotoka na kitoko kyandi kyaazimbala. Bwabobo mpe mvwama kaazimbidila na bisalu byandi.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvibidila ntontolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Kyese ku muntu wo kwe vibidilanga ntontolo, mu dyambu ti bu kameni vibidila zo, waatambula luzingu lu mimvu ka mumvu, lu siila Nzambi nsilulu ku yobobo bakwe mutyanga. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Ku nani muntu, bu kadi mutontolo, ka ta ti: «Nzambi wuna ntonta!» Mu dyambu ti mbi yilendi tonta Nzambi ko, mpe yandi bende katontanga muntu ko. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Kadi muntu kwe tontongo, mu dyambu di nzinunu zandi zikwe mu bendanga na zikwe mu natanga. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Mboki bu kameni landa nzinunu, zibutidi masumu, mpe masumu bu mayedidi, makwe natanga ku lufwa.<verse eid="JAS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Mpangi zani zizola, luhunukandi ko: <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Minkayulu mimvimba mi vudidi mimbote na mii milunga mikwe fumanga ku yulu, ku Tata, wu hidika bima bii ku yulu bikwe haananga kya. Yandi kakwe kitukanga ko, mpe ka bonso mposi yikwe hinganga bibuka ko. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Bonso bu luzolo lwandi, wutuhaana luzingu mu mambu mandi maa kedika, mwanki tuba bantete mu bima byandi bimvimba bi kahidika.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuyuwa na kusadila mambu ma Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Mpangi zani zi zola, zabeeno wo ti: Kadi muntu fweti ba na manzaki mu yuwa, kansi kalendi zonza munswalu ko, na kalendi baka mankesi munswalu ko, <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />mu dyambu ti mu mankesi, muntu kalendi hidika musamu wusungama ha meso ma Nzambi ko. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Ni hahoho, bikeno nsumukunu zimvimba, na misamu mimvimba mimbi mikwe fumanga mu mbalu. Mpe tambuleeno mu lembami Mambu ma kuna Nzambi mu mitima myeno, na ma lenda luvuukisa.<verse eid="JAS 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Sadilangeeno Mambu ma Nzambi, kansi ka mu me yuwanga kaka ko. Mu dyambu ti lulenda kihuna yeno bende mu mbanzulu zimbi. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Mu dyambu ti muntu kwe yuwanga Mambu ma Nzambi, mpe kwe lembolo me sadilanga, fwanakani bonso muntu wuna tala kini kyandi mu kitala-tala bonso bu kidi. <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />Bu kameni kitala, wele kwandi, mboki zimbakani bonso bu kadi. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Kansi muntu kwe toma fyongoninanga musiku wulunga, wukwe haananga kimpwanza, mpe tatamani mu sadila wo, ka zimbakana misamu mi kayudi ko, kansi wuna sadila myo, muntu bewowo waaba mu kyese mu kisalu kyandi.<verse eid="JAS 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Tala ti muntu wuna banzila ti yandi munsambidi wumbote kadi, kansi kazebi mu yaala ludimi lwandi ko, na wuna kihuna yandi bende, kinzambi kyandi kimpamba kidi. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Nsadulu yimbote yi dibundu yi vedila na yilembolo ba na busafu ha ntadisi yi Tata eto Nzambi, ni mu sadisa bisana na mafoola mu mpasi zawu, na mu lembolo sumuka mu misamu mi nza.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ka muswasikisanga ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Mpangi zani, yeno lukwe sanga kiminu mu Yesu-Klisto, Mfumu eto yi nkembo, luswasikisangandi bantu ko. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Yinduleeno eti, tala ti muntu wumosi wumvwama wizi kota ha lukutukunu lweno na wuu wulwata binkutu bintalu na kimpambula ki wola mu mulembo, mpe muntu wumosi wumputu wizi kota na binkutu bimvindu. <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />Tala ti kitalulu kyeno nkyezi ku yondowo lweti binkutu bintalu, na lumuteedidi ti: «Yiza wuzakala ha kibuka ki buzitu», na luteedi ku mputu ti: «Ngeye, telama ehaha», hoti «Zakala ha nsi, ha nsye malu mani», <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />luna yena ko ti ha kati dyeno diswasani luna sa e? Nga lukitukidi mimfundisi mikwe fundisanga mu mbanzulu awu zimbi ko e?<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Mpangi zani zizola, yuweeno: Nzambi wusoola bamputu mu nza beyiyi, mwanki bakituka zimvwama mu kiminu, na babyadila Kimfumu ki mazulu ki kasiila nsilulu ku yobobo bakwe mu tyanga. <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Kansi yeno, lukwe vwezanga bamputu! Ka bamvwama ko bakwe luyenisanga mpasi na bakwe lunatanga mu zinzo zi lufundusu e? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Ka yawu ko bakwe safulanga nkumbu yi mbote yi baluhaana e?<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Tala ti luna vumina musiku wu Kimfumu ki Nzambi bonso bu wuu wusonama ti: «Zola mfinangani aku bonso nge bende», buna bumbote luna sa. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Kansi tala ti luna swasikisa bantu, masumu luna sadila, mpe musiku wuna lubedisi mu dyambu ti luna vumina wo ko. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Tala ti muntu wuna vumina Misiku mimvimba, mboki sumuni musiku wakwa wumosi, waabedoso mu Misiku mimvimba. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Mu dyambu ti, yondowo wuta ti: «Kusadilandi kinsuza ko», wuta mpe ti: «Kuhondandi ko.» Kansi, tala ti kwe sadilanga kinsuza ko, kansi hondidi muntu, ngeye vumini Misiku mimvimba ko. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Ni hahoho, zonzangeeno, mpe dyatilangeeno bonso bantu bebobo baafundusu mu musiku wu kimpwanza. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Mu dyambu ti, Nzambi bu kaafundisa bantu, kaafwila nkenda ko ku yobobo bakwe lembolo fwilanga banawu nkenda. Kansi kufwila nkenda kukwe nungisanga muntu ha lufundusu.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiminu na mavanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Mpangi zani, nkye mfunu ku muntu mu ta ti: «Kiminu ki nani», tala ti kalendi kye lonka mu mavanga ko e? Nganunu, kiminu ki bobobo kilendi mu vuukisa e? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Tala ti mpangi eno yi bakala hoti yi mukento lembolo ba na binkutu bye lwata na bindya bi kadi kilumbu, <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />na wumosi ha kati dyeno wubateedidi ti: «Yendeeno mu kiyenge! lwateeno binkutu bi kyozi na Yendeeno ludya bumbote!» Kansi lubaheeni bima bi nawu mfunu ko, nkye mfunu mu myo mi lubateedidi e? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Bwabobo mpe kiminu kidi: tala ti kii na mavanga ko, buna kifwa kidi.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Kansi muntu mbo kata ti: «Ngeye kiminu ki naku, meno mavanga ma nani.» Ndongisa kiminu kyaku kilembolo ba na mavanga, mpe meno, mu mavanga mani naakulonkila kiminu kyani. <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Ngeye kwe kwikilanga ti Nzambi yimosi kwandi yidi e? Bumbote kwe sanga: mpeve zimbi mpe zikwe kwikilanga bobo, na zikwe zakamanga mu bunkunta.<verse eid="JAS 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Ngeye lembolo ba na madyela! Tiidi mu zaba ti kiminu kilembolo mavanga kifwa kidi e? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Nganunu Nzambi kabongila Abalahami, mukulu eto, bonso muntu wu lunungu mu dyambu di mavanga mandi ko e? Bu kahaana mwana andi Isaaki bonso munkayulu ha ziku di bakwe yokilanga minkayulu. <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Wuna yena ti kiminu kyandi kyedi yenika mu mavanga, mpe kiminu kyandi kilungusu mu mavanga. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Bwabobo Masonama mayendila detila ti: «Abalahami wukwikila Nzambi, na Nzambi ni kamubongila bonso muntu wu lunungu.» Nzambi ni kamutumisina ti nkayi ani. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Luyeni ti, muntu bakwe mu bikanga, muntu wu lunungu, mu mavanga mandi, kansi ka mu kiminu kaka ko.<verse eid="JAS 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Bwabobo mpe Lahabi, mukento wunsuza, wubiku bonso muntu wulunungu mu mavanga mandi, mu dyambu ti wubwana minketi mi Isaeli, na wubatinisa mu nzila yi hiika<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">lulendi tanga mpe mu</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOS 2:1-24">Yos 2.1-24</ref></char> <char style="fp" closed="false" /></note>. <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Bwabobo mpe nitu yi lembolo ba na mwela yifwa yidi, bwabobo mpe kiminu kilembolo ba na mavanga kifwa kidi.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ludimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Mpangi zani, lubandi babingi mu ba milongisi, mu dyambu ti yeto milongisi twaatambula mfundusu yi hyokidi kitezo. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Yeto bamvimba tukwe sanga masumu. Tala ti muntu kasumukanga mu nzonzolo ko, buna yandi wulunga kadi, na lenda yaala nitu andi yimvimba. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Bu tukwe tulanga mwa kisengo mu munwa wu zimpunda, mwanki ba tutumimina, tukwe twadisanga mpe nitu awu yimvimba. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Tubongeeno kifwani ki masuwa: nkatika mamanene madi mpe bitembo bingolo bikwe natanga mo, kansi mwa kima kifyoti kwandi kikwe twadisanga mo, na makwe tadisanga kuma ni kuma kutiidi kinati mu twadisa mo. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Bumosi mpe ludimi, mwa kinama kifyoti kinitu kidi, kansi lukwe kitumpidikanga mu misamu miminene. Taleeno bonso buu mwa tiya tufyoti, tukwe lenda mu yoka kibiti kikinene ki mukobo.<verse eid="JAS 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Ludimi mpe tiya tudi. Lwalolo mpe ludi kibuka ki misamu mimbi mu kati di nitu eto. Lukwe sumunanga nitu eto yimvimba, mpe lukwe yokanga luzingu lweto lumvimba, mboki lwabende lukwe hyanga ku tiya tu mbungulu. <verse eid="JAS 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Muntu wuu na lulendo mu lemvola makanda mamvimba ma bibulu bi nsye mpanda, zinuni, mwa bibulu bikwe kwe syelomokingi ha nsi, na mbizi zi mamba, muntu bya kakwe lemvolanga. <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Kansi kunaani muntu kwe lendanga mu yaala ludimi, mu dyambu ti kima kimbi kidi na ki bakwe lembolo simbanga, mpe luu lufuluka mu miswa mikwe hondanga. <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Mu yandi tukwe sakumuninanga Nzambi, Tata eto. Mpe mu yandi tukwe singilanga bantu ba hidika Nzambi mu kifwani kyandi. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Mu munwa wumosi kwandi tukwe duukisilanga mpova zi lusakumunu na zinsingulu. Mpangi zani, ka bufweni ko ti bubela bobo. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Mukelo wumosi wulenda duukisa mamba madoda na ma ndudi e? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Mpangi zani, muti wu fike wulenda buta mbutu zi olive, hoti muti wu vinu wulenda buta mbutu zi fike e? Bumosi mpe, mukelo wumosi wulendi duukisa mamba ma mungwa na mamba madoda ko.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndwenga zi fumini ku yulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Nani ha kati dyeno wuu na ndwenga na madyela e? Kalonka bo mu nkadulu andi yimbote, mu mavanga mandi mana sadulu mu lembami, na mu ndwenga. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Kansi tala ti mutima aku wufulukidi mu musoki wuhita na mu mpeve yi kimpala, kusandi mayama ko mu kilonka ti muntu wuu ndwenga na ku bebisandi kedika mu luvunu ko. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Ndwenga zibobo zikwe fumanga ku yulu ko, kansi zi ki nza, zi kimuntu, mpe zi nkadyampemba. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Mu dyambu ti huuma ha musoki na mpeve yi kimpala, mvwanzi na misamu mimvimba mimbi milendi kondo ko. <verse eid="JAS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Kansi ndwenga zikwe fumanga ku yulu ntetete zi zivedila, mboki zikwe twalanga kiyenge, kizunu, kintwadi, nkenda mpe na mimbutu mimbote. Zikwe swasikisanga bantu ko mpe zi na diisu ku nsye lukaya ko. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Bantu bakwe tukisanga kiyenge ha kati dyawu, bakwe kunanga na bakwe yonzikanga mu kiyenge, luzingu lukwe tyanga Nzambi.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kikundi na nza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Kwedi kukwe fumanga mvita na bikindu ha kati dyeno e? Ka ni zinsatu zeno zimbi ko zikwe nwanisanga binama bi nitu byeno e? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Luna zinina bima, na luna bye baka ko, mimvondi ludi mpe lufulukidi mu musoki, mpe lulendi baka kani kima ko. Mboki lukwe sanga mvita na bikindu. Lulendi baka kima ko, mu dyambu ti lukwe lombanga ko. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Bu lukwe lombanga, yeno lukwe tambulanga ko mu dyambu ti bumbi lukwe lombilanga. Yeno lukwe lombanga mu yangidika kwandi nsatu zeno. <verse eid="JAS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Yeno bantu ba kinsuza ludi! Luzebi ko ti wumana ba mukundi wu nza, weka mutantu wu Nzambi e? Ni hahoho, wonso tiidi mu ba mukundi wu nza, weka mbeni yi Nzambi. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Luna banza ti mu mpamba Masonama mana teela ti: «Na kimbanda kyonso Nzambi kakwe tilanga mpeve yi kwe zinganga mu yeto.» <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Kansi, Nzambi kwe tuhaananga lusakumunu luvudidi bunene, mu dyambu ti wusonama ti: «Nzambi katiidi banga mayama ko, kansi kwe sanga mbote ku banga luyinunu.» <verse eid="JAS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Ni hahoho, tumimineeno Nzambi, tedimineeno nkadyampemba, mpe yandi waatina kitatu neeno. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Finameeno ku Nzambi, mpe yandi waafinama ku yeno. Yeno minsumuki, sukuleeno moko meno, na yeno banga mitima myole<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yeno banga mitima myole </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bulendi ba mpe bantu bana diisu ku nsye lukaya</char></note>, vediseeno mitima myeno! <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Bakuleno mpasi zeno, beno mu kifwidi, na dileeno. Bika tuseho tweno tu kaluka bidilu, na kyese kyeno ki kaluka kyadi. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Kikululeeno ha ntadisi yi Mfumu, mpe yandi waaluzangula.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lufundisandi zimpangi zeno ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Mpangi zani, lutesasanandi yeno na yeno misamu mimbi ko. Wonso waatesa munandi misamu mimbi hoti wafundisa mpangi andi, yandi vwezidi na fundisi Misiku. Wumana fundisa Misiku, wuna misadila ko, kansi ngeye weka mumfundisi wu Misiku. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Mu dyambu ti Nzambi kwandi yandi hiika kwe hekanga Misiku mpe wuu mumfundisi. Yandi kwandi lenda vuukisa na hondisa. Kansi ngeye nani wudi mu fundisa munaku e?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntontolo zi bimvwama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Yuweno bwabu, yeno lukwe tanga ti: «Bubu hoti mbazi twaakwenda ku mbanza eyi, na mumvu wumosi twaahyokisa koko, twaasa mumbungu, mpe twaabaka mbongo.» <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Yeno luzebi ko nki byaalutudila mbazi! Kadi, luzingu lweno ludi bonso dibungi dikwe yenikanga mu mwa ntangu mboki dikwe zimbalanga. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Taleno bwedi lulenda zonzilanga: «Mfumu kamana tya, twaazinga, mpe twaahidika musamu ewu hoti ewuna.» <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Kansi yeno luna kitumpidika mu mpova zeno zi mayama. Mayama mabobobo mambi madi. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Tala ti muntu zebi mu hidika musamu wumbote, na kahidikidi wo ko, disumu kasiidi.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ndwengosolo ku bamvwama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Ku yeno bamvwama bwabu, dileeno na yendeeno kungi mu dyambu di mpasi zaalutudila. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Bimvwama byeno byeka bibola na zinsyedi zi meni dya binkutu byeno. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Wola dyeno na mbongo zeno zimeni kota mbungi. Mbungi beyoyo yina lonka kimbangi kina lubedisa, na yaayoka nitu eno bonso tiya. Lumeni yonzika bimvwama mu bilumbu bizimunina. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Yeno lubisidi mufuta bisadi bikwe yonzikanga mu zimfuba zeno. Miloko myawu mitudidi mu makutu ma Mfumu Sebaoti. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Luzingidi mu byese ha butoto na mu bimvwama. Luyukuti na Lukitukidi navwele-vwele, bonso bibulu mu kilumbu ki bya hondo. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Lubedisi, na luhondisi bantu balembolo zaba dyambu mpe babisidi ko.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luvibudulu na lusambulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Mpangi zani, beno na mvibudulu natee mu mvutukulu yi Mfumu. Taleno bonso kisadi kimfuba: kwe kingilanga mimbutu mimbote mikwe fumanga mu butoto kutonina mimbutu mintete mi mvula zintombo natee mu mimbutu mi mvula zimanunu zindolo. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Yeno mpe, beno na mvibudulu, kindiseeno mitima myeno, mu dyambu ti mvutukulu yi Mfumu yeka lukufi.<verse eid="JAS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Mpangi zani, lunyungutilagandi baneeno, mwanki lulembolo fundusu. Taleno, mumfundisi telamani ha mwelo. <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Mpangi zani, mu mpasi na mvibudulu, bongeeno kifwani ki mimbikudi mi zonza mu nkumbu yi Mfumu. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Tukwe tanga ti kyese ku yobobo bakwe vibidilanga. Luyuwa mvibudulu yi Yobi, mboki luzebi nkye musendo katambula ku Mfumu ku nsukunu, mu dyambu ti Mfumu wufuluka kadi mu nkenda na zola.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Mpangi zani, tekila misamu mimvimba, ludyangandi ndefi mu nkumbu yi yulu hoti mu nkumbu yi butoto ko, mpe ka ndefi yi mutindu wuhiika ko. Kansi bika ninga yeno yiba ninga, na kaani dyeno diba kaani. Mwanki lulembolo fundusu.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Wonso muntu ha kati dyeno wuu mu mpasi, biika kasambila. Wonso muntu ha kati dyeno wuu mu kyese, biika kayimbila mikunga mi masiika. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Wumosi ha kati dyeno wuu na kimbevo, biika katumisa bakuluntu ba dibundu, biza bamusambidila mpe bamukusa mafuta mu nkumbu yi Mfumu. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Lusambulu lu kiminu lwaanyakisa mbevo, mpe Mfumu waamutedimisa. Tala ti masumu kasiidi, Mfumu waamulemvokila. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Ni hahoho, funguleeno masumu meno yeno na yeno, mpe sambidilangeeno zimpangi zeno yeno na yeno, mwanki lunyaka. Lusambulu lu muntu wulunungu lulendo ludi. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Eliya wuba muntu bonso yeto. Wutatamana mu sambila, mwanki mvula zilembolo bwesa noka, na mimvu mitatu na ngonda sambanu ha butoto ha noka mvula ko. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Mboki wusambila dyaka, yulu ni di nokisa mvula, na butoto ni bubuta mimbutu.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Mpangi zani, tala ti ha kati dyeno muntu wumosi zimbakani nzila yi kedika, mpe muntu wuhiika wumuvutudi, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />zabeeno ti yondowo waavutula munsumuki mu nzila yi kazimbakani, waamuvuukisa mu lufwa, na waasa ti masumu mamingi makatuka.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>